{"type":"standard","title":"Ashley Hinson","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Ashley Hinson</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q60713905","titles":{"canonical":"Ashley_Hinson","normalized":"Ashley Hinson","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Ashley Hinson</span></span>"},"pageid":59720955,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c8/Congresswoman_Ashley_Hinson_Official_portrait.jpg/330px-Congresswoman_Ashley_Hinson_Official_portrait.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":495},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c8/Congresswoman_Ashley_Hinson_Official_portrait.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":1365,"height":2048},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1378757709","tid":"360d7cca-c125-11f1-9d88-af6fcfd49405","timestamp":"2026-10-06T01:28:19Z","description":"American politician and journalist (born 1983)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ashley_Hinson","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ashley_Hinson?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ashley_Hinson?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Ashley_Hinson"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ashley_Hinson","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Ashley_Hinson","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ashley_Hinson?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Ashley_Hinson"}},"extract":"Ashley Elizabeth Hinson is an American politician and journalist serving as the U.S. representative for Iowa's 2nd congressional district since 2021. The district, numbered as the 1st district during her first term, covers much of northeastern Iowa, including Cedar Rapids, Waterloo, Cedar Falls, and Dubuque.","extract_html":"<p><b>Ashley Elizabeth Hinson</b> is an American politician and journalist serving as the U.S. representative for Iowa's 2nd congressional district since 2021. The district, numbered as the 1st district during her first term, covers much of northeastern Iowa, including Cedar Rapids, Waterloo, Cedar Falls, and Dubuque.</p>"}